<title>INDIA: India's SEBI allows foreign investment in gilts.</title>
<headline>India's SEBI allows foreign investment in gilts.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's markets regulator, the Securities and Exchange Board of India (SEBI), on Thursday said it had permitted foreign institutions to invest in dated government securities.</p>
</text>
